WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.030
RUFUS: More than it had before, yes.

00:00:02.210 --> 00:00:07.519
ALEX: The other reading: the people
who've committed twenty-six billion
dollars already supply

00:00:07.519 --> 00:00:12.827
ALEX: the compute, the distribution, the
sales channels. The accountability is
real, but

00:00:12.827 --> 00:00:18.136
ALEX: the power structure underneath it
was set before the opening bell.

00:00:18.316 --> 00:00:23.502
JAMIE: Rufus, did you actually consider
calling twenty-six billion a modest
start?

00:00:23.587 --> 00:00:26.415
RUFUS: I considered it. Decided it was
uncharitable to everyone's intelligence,
including my

00:00:26.415 --> 00:00:29.242
RUFUS: own.
